# ─── SCF licensed catalogue content — NEVER commit ───────────────────────────
# SCF control content is licensed (CC BY-ND 4.0 + a separate commercial licence) and
# MUST NOT be redistributed in this open-source repo. These files are GENERATED at install
# time from the operator's own SCF Excel workbook by the catalogue importer
# (scripts/extract_scf_data.py → docker compose --profile init run --rm catalog-importer).
# Bring your own SCF catalogue; do not check these in.
webclient/public/data/control_guidance.json
webclient/public/data/controls_mapping.json
webclient/public/data/controls_v3.json
webclient/public/data/erl.json
webclient/public/data/frameworks.json
webclient/public/data/assessment_objectives.json
webclient/public/data/domains.json
webclient/public/data/catalog_meta.json
# Operator-supplied SCF source workbook (input to the importer)
catalog-source/*.xlsx
# NOTE: curated, NON-SCF catalogue files are intentionally tracked and DO ship:
#   capability_themes.json, collection_interfaces.json, evidence_templates.json,
#   system_collection_recipes.json, README.md
backend/alembic/versions/__pycache__/*
.gitnexus

# Live dev demo (scripts/dev-demo.sh) — local state, logs, generated keys
.dev-demo/
webclient/.env.demo
webclient/vite.config.local.mts

# ─── Test-system uploads — NEVER commit ──────────────────────────────────────
# docker-compose bind-mounts ./backend to /app in the backend container, so
# anything copied into the container for testing (docker cp, CDM ingest
# fixtures, sample evidence) lands directly in this working tree. Real customer
# policy and evidence documents are routinely used to exercise the CDM
# pipeline; none of it may ever reach this repo, which ships open-source.
backend/policies/
backend/uploads/
backend/test-documents/
backend/sample-evidence/
backend/fixtures-local/
# Documents of any kind under the mounted backend dir. Nothing legitimate in
# backend/ is a .docx/.pdf/.xlsx — real fixtures live in backend/tests/ as code.
backend/**/*.docx
backend/**/*.doc
backend/**/*.pdf
backend/**/*.pptx
backend/**/*.xlsx
backend/**/*.xlsm
backend/**/*.odt
backend/**/*.ods
# Ad-hoc analysis / seeding scripts run inside the container during testing
backend/cdm_*_proof.py
backend/cdm_*_seed*.py
backend/analyse_*.py
backend/ingest_real_*.py
